ملخص تسلسلي للتدفق
$$\text{المستخدم يكتب} \xrightarrow{\text{Enter/Click}} \texttt{sendMessage()} \xrightarrow{\text{WS JSON}} \texttt{ws_handler()}$$

$$\xrightarrow{\texttt{_process_ai_chat()}} \texttt{provider.stream()} \xrightarrow{\text{chunk queue}} \texttt{_safe_ws_send(chunk)}$$

$$\xrightarrow{\texttt{handleWSMessage()}} \texttt{appendStreamChunk()} \xrightarrow{\text{finalizeStreamMessage()}} \text{عرض الرد كاملاً}$$

